  additions (`SIDE_CHAT_READ_ONLY_TOOLS` import, `sideChatSuffix` in the prompt suffix array, the
  read-only `baseRunAllow`/`runAllow` filtering, and `sideChat: opts.sideChat === true` on the saved run).
